Usage: playstats-hub <command>
  status        Show whether the application is running
  logs [lines]  Show the latest log lines
  follow        Follow the log
  restart       Restart the application
  stop | start  Stop or start the application
  setup-code    Show the code asked by the first-run setup page
  add-admin <id> Make a SteamID64 an administrator of the site
  backup [file] Save the database, avatars and configuration in one file
  restore <file> Replace the current data with a backup file
  update [tag]  Install the latest version, or the given one, keeping the data
